      $staph-nucl-H124L 'recombinant technology' E.coli Escherichia coli BL21(DE3) plasmid pTSN2cc 
;
native (Modified pTSN2cc (plasmid copy control region restored).
Recombinant nuclease contains LEU at position 124 (sequence identical
to that of the nuclease A  produced by the V8 strain of S. aureus).)
; 

